  "id": "cultural-transmission",
  "term": "cultural transmission",
  "definition": "Cultural transmission is the passing of attitudes, beliefs, and behaviour patterns between people, especially across generations and through social networks. It can occur vertically within families, such as from parents and grandparents to children, and horizontally through peers, with the balance of these influences differing across traits.",
